{
  "id": "poem-401502f1afef9c826dc247f2",
  "title": "同前",
  "author": "无名氏《张协状元》",
  "dynasty": "元",
  "verses": [
    "你莫打渠，苦必苦，厮打你每早先输。",
    "你腰我腰，没钱又无米。",
    "(合)担儿把去，今夜两个在那里睡！。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "元曲选",
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/元曲/yuanqu.json#record-2481",
